WEBVTT

00:00:31.991 --> 00:00:33.743
With this sacred water

00:00:33.993 --> 00:00:39.123
from the blue depths of The Hole,
the source of the Grand Lake,

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:44.337
I celebrate and bear witness to this
compact between Anatoray and Turan.

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:53.638
Vincent Alzey, Commander-in-Chief
of the Vanguard Unit

00:00:53.888 --> 00:00:55.765
of the United Kingdom of Anatoray-Disith.

00:00:56.015 --> 00:01:00.686
On behalf of the Anatoray government,
I do hereby covenant with Turan.

00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:13.032
Millia il Velch Cutrettola Turan.

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:18.037
As proxy for the Kingdom of Turan
and Liliana, its regent,

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:20.831
I do hereby covenant with Anatoray.

00:01:33.261 --> 00:01:39.850
<i>Soko ni nani ga aru toshite mo</i>

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:48.526
<i>Mikai no ryouiki e kimi to</i>

00:01:56.784 --> 00:02:04.834
<i>Mijikai yume wo miteta ima</i>

00:02:05.084 --> 00:02:09.463
<i>Are wa kimi no senaka</i>

00:02:09.714 --> 00:02:15.636
<i>Kako? Mirai?</i>

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:26.397
<i>Furikitte iru meetaa no hari wo mushi shite</i>

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:29.525
<i>Oikaze to kanjou no muku hou e</i>

00:02:29.775 --> 00:02:35.698
<i>Habataku tabi kizukasareru</i>

00:02:35.948 --> 00:02:41.245
<i>Nido to deaenai sora ga aru koto</i>

00:02:41.495 --> 00:02:46.751
<i>Sore demo tobitatsu nara</i>

00:02:47.001 --> 00:02:53.549
<i>Kimi no tsubasa ni naru watashi ga</i>

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:15.571
Whew, my shoulders are stiff...

00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:17.323
It was nerve-wracking, wasn't it?

00:03:17.573 --> 00:03:21.577
Millia looked beautiful, though!
She's a genuine princess for sure!

00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:25.039
She truly was back to
her old exquisite self...!

00:03:25.289 --> 00:03:27.708
Yeah, Millia's really something!

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:30.252
Fam! Gisey!

00:03:30.503 --> 00:03:33.255
You really went and built a fleet for Millia!

00:03:33.506 --> 00:03:36.509
You even managed to get
Silvius the Reaper to join our side!

00:03:36.759 --> 00:03:39.095
You're my rival all right, Fam!

00:03:39.345 --> 00:03:40.388
Rival? You wish!

00:03:40.638 --> 00:03:43.349
--Don't be embarrassed!
--I'm not!

00:03:44.517 --> 00:03:46.811
Well, we better go!

00:03:47.061 --> 00:03:49.814
Gonna go scatter these around the world!

00:03:50.064 --> 00:03:54.610
"Anatoray and Turan form alliance
to oppose Federation invasions!"

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:58.864
"Gather, fellow citizens of the world,
and fight for your freedom!"

00:03:59.115 --> 00:04:00.616
Ooh, sounds good!

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:02.368
Doesn't it, though?

00:04:05.413 --> 00:04:07.331
It's non-alcoholic, I'm sorry to say.

00:04:07.581 --> 00:04:09.583
We're countin' on you to
spread word about the alliance!

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:13.087
We loaded ya up with gifts too!
Just don't go crashin' from all the weight!

00:04:13.337 --> 00:04:16.257
Thanks! The kids are gonna love it!

00:04:16.507 --> 00:04:18.175
Fair winds to you!

00:04:18.426 --> 00:04:20.344
--Fair winds to you!
--Fair winds to you!

00:04:21.846 --> 00:04:23.639
Good tailwinds!

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:27.977
Tell everyone we say hi!

00:04:31.939 --> 00:04:33.274
Cheers to our alliance!

00:04:33.524 --> 00:04:36.318
Cheers!

00:04:42.116 --> 00:04:44.660
My fellows! The Federation is mighty!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:49.748
But if we keep the fire of our new alliance
burning and continue to recruit allies,

00:04:49.999 --> 00:04:51.750
it will ultimately become a great conflagration

00:04:52.001 --> 00:04:54.545
capable of destroying
the Federation's ambitions!

00:04:54.795 --> 00:04:56.839
May victory be ours!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:01.552
People of Anatoray.

00:05:01.802 --> 00:05:03.554
You have my deepest thanks

00:05:03.804 --> 00:05:06.724
for granting us territory when
we had nowhere else to turn!

00:05:06.974 --> 00:05:10.853
Once again, Turan welcomes
Anatoray's return home!

00:05:11.103 --> 00:05:13.105
Let us work together,

00:05:13.355 --> 00:05:16.567
with respect for one another's independence,
to make this world a bountiful one!

00:05:24.867 --> 00:05:26.410
Dio.

00:05:28.496 --> 00:05:31.123
So, have you touched the clouds?

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:42.301
Look! Fourteen Federation
battleships and one unknown.

00:05:42.551 --> 00:05:44.637
Any signs of combat activities?

00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:46.514
Unable to confirm.

00:05:50.309 --> 00:05:51.227
So stuffed...

00:05:51.477 --> 00:05:54.355
--How about dessert?
--Save some for later...

00:05:54.605 --> 00:05:57.608
I can't go on... My dress is too tight...

00:06:01.111 --> 00:06:05.616
I made this coffee myself.
It's an Urbanus institution.

00:06:05.866 --> 00:06:07.535
Thank you!

00:06:10.746 --> 00:06:13.040
Bitter! What is this?

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:17.628
Congratulations. It looks like
all your hard work has paid off.

00:06:17.878 --> 00:06:22.758
Thank you. I solemnly vow to honor
my sister's agreements with you.

00:06:23.008 --> 00:06:26.095
As the main Anatoray forces have yet to arrive,

00:06:26.345 --> 00:06:28.764
we severely lack military might.

00:06:29.014 --> 00:06:32.351
Hence your covert activities?

00:06:32.601 --> 00:06:35.479
Therefore, I'd like to ask someone
knowledgeable about this world.

00:06:35.729 --> 00:06:39.984
Who else should we have
join our alliance immediately?

00:06:40.234 --> 00:06:45.447
If you want military muscle, the northern
nation of Glacies is your best bet.

00:06:45.698 --> 00:06:49.910
But they've cut off all
relations with outside nations.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.872
Not to mention the Silvius
commenced hostilities with them...

00:06:54.123 --> 00:06:56.500
Getting nations of such different
governments and cultures

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.544
to see eye-to-eye is no easy task.

00:06:58.794 --> 00:07:03.215
Not even we Sky Pirates have
ironclad solidarity, in fact.

00:07:04.383 --> 00:07:06.969
Is this what they call an "adult flavor"?

00:07:19.064 --> 00:07:20.774
Who are you...?

00:07:22.985 --> 00:07:26.155
Let me introduce you. This is Alvis Hamilton.

00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:27.573
Don't be afraid.

00:07:27.823 --> 00:07:30.534
I'm Fam Fan Fan. Call me Fam!

00:07:30.784 --> 00:07:33.662
--And this is...
--I'm Millia.

00:07:33.912 --> 00:07:37.124
--And next to her is Gisey.
--It's nice to meet you!

00:07:37.374 --> 00:07:42.087
Alvis can control the Anatoray Exile.

00:07:42.338 --> 00:07:43.797
An Exile?!

00:07:44.048 --> 00:07:46.508
There's no need to be scared, Millia.

00:07:46.759 --> 00:07:48.802
AI is my friend.

00:07:56.935 --> 00:07:59.980
Despite all the people she's lost
and all the hardships she's endured,

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:04.151
Al is always kind and considerate of others.

00:08:04.401 --> 00:08:06.862
Much like your sister, Millia.

00:08:08.489 --> 00:08:14.244
Dio explained everything to me.
That you two are just like me...

00:08:14.495 --> 00:08:16.205
"You two"?

00:08:16.455 --> 00:08:18.040
The power to activate an Exile

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.585
is passed down among the women
in the Turan royal family.

00:08:21.835 --> 00:08:25.339
From mother to daughter,
daughter to granddaughter...

00:08:26.507 --> 00:08:29.093
The dormant Exiles in orbit above

00:08:29.343 --> 00:08:32.388
will descend to the planet when called by one.

00:08:32.638 --> 00:08:35.140
Only one female has this ability.

00:08:35.391 --> 00:08:39.061
Should she die, the ability goes to
the next family member closest in age;

00:08:39.311 --> 00:08:43.232
to her daughter or
younger sister, in other words.

00:08:43.482 --> 00:08:45.526
But I don't have that power...!

00:08:48.237 --> 00:08:50.739
Your sister is alive.

00:08:54.159 --> 00:08:56.120
That's great news, Millia!

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:03.127
They're coming!

00:09:03.377 --> 00:09:05.587
Federation ships approaching!
All hands to battle stations!

00:09:05.838 --> 00:09:07.047
Federation ships approaching!

00:09:07.297 --> 00:09:08.674
All hands to battle stations!

00:09:08.924 --> 00:09:12.010
Engine acoustics lDed!
It's the Federation ship Impetus!

00:09:12.261 --> 00:09:13.679
Luscinia?

00:09:13.929 --> 00:09:15.931
Flags spotted! The Federation Premier's flag...

00:09:16.181 --> 00:09:18.267
...and a Turan princess's flag!

00:09:18.517 --> 00:09:20.060
A Tu ran princess?!

00:09:23.731 --> 00:09:25.190
Sister?!

00:09:37.578 --> 00:09:39.413
I had no idea Princess Liliana was still alive...!

00:09:39.663 --> 00:09:40.706
I can hardly believe it!

00:09:40.956 --> 00:09:43.625
Did the Federation take her captive?!

00:09:51.425 --> 00:09:52.760
Sister!

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:55.304
Oh, it really is Princess Lily!

00:10:00.809 --> 00:10:03.145
Sister! I'm so happy you're all right!

00:10:03.395 --> 00:10:06.607
Thank you for all your hard work, Millia.

00:10:08.066 --> 00:10:12.404
Fam. Giselle. Thank you for helping Millia.

00:10:12.654 --> 00:10:14.698
N-Not at all!

00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:18.869
--U-Umm, Sister--
--Are you the Anatoray commander?

00:10:20.037 --> 00:10:21.705
Vincent Alzey.

00:10:21.955 --> 00:10:24.917
I am a plenipotentiary of
the Anatoray government.

00:10:25.167 --> 00:10:27.836
I humbly appreciate your
solicitude for my sister.

00:10:28.086 --> 00:10:30.506
I only did what anyone in my position would do.

00:10:32.049 --> 00:10:34.384
Beloved people of Turan!

00:10:34.635 --> 00:10:36.428
That you have endured grave difficulty

00:10:36.678 --> 00:10:39.973
and held fast to your loyalty fills me with pride.

00:10:40.224 --> 00:10:44.520
However, your struggles are at last rewarded.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:49.733
To carry on my late father's
aspirations, I have decided...

00:10:51.401 --> 00:10:55.864
...that I, Liliana il Grazioso Merlo Turan
shall assume control of Turan.

00:11:00.369 --> 00:11:05.332
To carry on my late father's
aspirations, I have decided...

00:11:07.084 --> 00:11:11.880
...that I, Liliana il Grazioso Merlo Turan
shall assume control of Turan.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.341
As royal ruler, I proclaim to all:

00:11:14.591 --> 00:11:17.553
The fighting between Turan
and the Federation is over.

00:11:19.096 --> 00:11:22.599
Federation Premier Luscinia Héfez!

00:11:37.823 --> 00:11:41.243
Turan has made peace with the Federation.

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:46.832
Once unified under Federation order,
the world will enter an age of peace.

00:11:47.082 --> 00:11:48.250
Peace...?!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:52.462
Then she's basically sold
Turan to the Federation!

00:11:53.255 --> 00:11:57.384
People of Turan. Her Majesty
Liliana speaks the truth.

00:11:57.634 --> 00:12:00.137
Rest easy and abide by her words.

00:12:00.387 --> 00:12:04.474
The Federation guarantees your protection.

00:12:06.351 --> 00:12:08.729
H-Hurrah for peace!

00:12:08.979 --> 00:12:11.356
Long live Her Majesty Liliana!

00:12:18.989 --> 00:12:20.532
What's going to happen to the fleet?

00:12:20.782 --> 00:12:23.660
It looks like Princess Liliana
is in charge of it now...

00:12:23.911 --> 00:12:26.705
You mean she's taking it away from Millia?!

00:12:26.955 --> 00:12:28.332
That's not right!

00:12:28.582 --> 00:12:31.376
We built that fleet ourselves, for Millia!

00:12:33.378 --> 00:12:35.964
Quite a masterful performance, indeed.

00:12:37.507 --> 00:12:40.802
It sounds like what we call
"annexation" and "domination,"

00:12:41.053 --> 00:12:43.180
the Federation calls
"affiliation" and "protection."

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.559
I've received reports regarding
Anatoray's terrorist actions.

00:12:47.809 --> 00:12:50.938
Are you the captain of the Silvius?

00:12:51.188 --> 00:12:54.191
To think that a female was her captain...

00:12:54.441 --> 00:12:56.860
Even though it was the result of
an unfortunate misunderstanding,

00:12:57.110 --> 00:13:01.114
her ability to thwart our
fleets was most admirable.

00:13:01.365 --> 00:13:04.034
If you agree to relinquish the Silvius
and swear allegiance to the Federation,

00:13:04.284 --> 00:13:06.620
I will overlook your acts of terrorism.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.372
And if I refuse?

00:13:08.622 --> 00:13:12.167
You have ten minutes. Think carefully.

00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:16.713
Sister!

00:13:16.964 --> 00:13:20.008
Have you forgotten what
the Federation did to Turan?!

00:13:20.258 --> 00:13:22.844
This is for the sake of the world.

00:13:23.095 --> 00:13:25.180
What are you going to do with our fleet?!

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:28.684
Millia. Your role in this has ended.

00:13:28.934 --> 00:13:30.894
You will hold your tongue and come with me.

00:13:31.144 --> 00:13:33.730
I can't go with you.

00:13:33.981 --> 00:13:36.066
Turan's territory is right here.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:47.953
If you will not obey me, then I strip you
of your status as a royal princess.

00:13:48.203 --> 00:13:51.164
As of today, we are no longer
sisters or anything else.

00:13:51.415 --> 00:13:53.083
Sister!

00:13:54.668 --> 00:13:57.629
Our next meeting will be on the battlefield.

00:14:11.393 --> 00:14:15.313
Luscinia is controlling
Princess Lily. I just know it!

00:14:15.564 --> 00:14:17.858
<i>She will listen</i> to <i>reason!</i>

00:14:18.108 --> 00:14:21.695
Yeah! I'll go steal her back!

00:14:24.781 --> 00:14:29.161
Just one order from Liliana and
Millia's fleet will be turned against us.

00:14:29.411 --> 00:14:31.538
Even with Princess Millia aboard?

00:14:31.788 --> 00:14:34.458
I assume the soldiers will follow my sister.

00:14:35.667 --> 00:14:37.627
Shall we give them the Silvius?

00:14:37.878 --> 00:14:40.964
I somehow doubt they'd leave us unharmed.

00:14:41.214 --> 00:14:43.091
What should I do...?

00:14:43.341 --> 00:14:45.886
Losing heart won't help anything.

00:14:46.136 --> 00:14:51.433
Our alliance was entirely with
Millia il Velch Cutrettola Turan.

00:14:51.683 --> 00:14:54.478
Yeah! As long as you're on the Silvius,

00:14:54.728 --> 00:14:57.064
the Turan refugee government is eternal!

00:15:02.152 --> 00:15:03.945
Orders from the Impetus!

00:15:04.196 --> 00:15:06.531
Prepare to attack the Silvius!

00:15:06.782 --> 00:15:07.866
What?!

00:15:08.116 --> 00:15:10.911
We can't attack a ship with Lady Millia on board!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.290
Princess Liliana!

00:15:17.334 --> 00:15:21.922
As of now, this ship is the Turan flagship Lasas

00:15:22.172 --> 00:15:25.175
and is henceforth under my direct command.

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:32.808
<i>--Y um'.
“Cake! Cake'.!</i>

00:15:33.058 --> 00:15:36.812
Will we get to eat this <i>every</i> day
if we stay friends with Anatoray?!

00:15:37.062 --> 00:15:39.064
Yeah, pretty much.

00:15:39.314 --> 00:15:41.274
Then hurry and be allies with 'em!

00:15:41.525 --> 00:15:45.654
Allies! Allies!

00:15:45.904 --> 00:15:47.322
How are the leaflets coming?

00:15:47.572 --> 00:15:49.533
I'm having 'em printed as quick as possible.

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:52.869
Guess I'll get some shut-eye until then.

00:15:57.833 --> 00:15:59.960
Federation's 3rd Fleet spotted!

00:16:05.549 --> 00:16:07.259
Target destroyed!

00:16:07.509 --> 00:16:09.427
Passable accuracy.

00:16:09.678 --> 00:16:11.555
I bet they're panicking now!

00:16:11.805 --> 00:16:14.599
They thought they could relax
as long as they were above

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:16.393
our battleships' altitude limits!

00:16:16.643 --> 00:16:20.605
Detestable Sky Pirates.
The time for payback has come.

00:16:26.403 --> 00:16:28.572
Traitors! Why are you shooting?!

00:16:28.822 --> 00:16:31.408
Those are all Millia's ships!

00:16:46.715 --> 00:16:48.633
We'll provide cover for
the Urbanus' withdrawal!

00:16:48.884 --> 00:16:49.843
R°gefl

00:16:50.093 --> 00:16:51.761
Commence firing!

00:16:56.349 --> 00:16:57.809
I'm relieved to see you're unharmed.

00:16:58.059 --> 00:17:01.104
Full combat speed! We're withdrawing!

00:17:03.607 --> 00:17:04.900
Commence fire!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:07.319
But Lady Millia is aboard that ship...!

00:17:07.569 --> 00:17:09.779
Such is fate.

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:11.573
Now fire!

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:22.876
This is totally messed up...

00:17:23.126 --> 00:17:24.336
Fam! Where are you going?!

00:17:24.586 --> 00:17:27.297
--To get Princess Lily back!
--Wait!

00:17:32.385 --> 00:17:34.095
Turan ship ahead!

00:17:34.346 --> 00:17:35.722
We've been cut off...

00:17:35.972 --> 00:17:37.140
Change course!

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.184
There's not enough time!

00:17:39.434 --> 00:17:42.520
Full speed ahead! Cut past it with our ram!

00:17:50.904 --> 00:17:53.114
Urbanus has withdrawn!

00:17:53.365 --> 00:17:55.158
Good. Now it's our turn to leave.

00:17:55.408 --> 00:17:57.494
Continue firing! Full speed ahead!

00:17:57.744 --> 00:17:59.371
Full speed ahead!

00:18:03.041 --> 00:18:06.127
What are you doing, #5 Turret?!
Don't stop firing!

00:18:06.378 --> 00:18:08.213
#5 Turret! Respond!

00:18:08.463 --> 00:18:10.882
#5 Turret! #5 Turret!

00:18:11.132 --> 00:18:13.969
--Has it taken enemy fire?!
--Negative!

00:18:14.219 --> 00:18:16.054
Go confirm the situation!

00:18:24.437 --> 00:18:25.647
Fam, wait!

00:18:25.897 --> 00:18:27.274
Go back, Millia!

00:18:27.524 --> 00:18:30.026
We'll return with Princess Lily in no time!

00:18:30.277 --> 00:18:32.529
She isn't being controlled at all!

00:18:32.779 --> 00:18:34.155
She's serious! I saw it in her eyes!

00:18:34.406 --> 00:18:37.575
She won't listen to me anymore!

00:18:37.826 --> 00:18:39.577
Millia...

00:18:48.211 --> 00:18:49.838
It's you again...

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:57.804
Die!

00:18:58.054 --> 00:19:00.557
Fam! Take care of Millia!

00:19:00.807 --> 00:19:02.600
Get as far away as you can! Hurry!

00:19:02.851 --> 00:19:04.769
All right! Let's go!

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.563
But...

00:19:08.273 --> 00:19:10.358
See you later!

00:19:14.904 --> 00:19:16.573
What the...?!

00:19:16.823 --> 00:19:20.243
Intruders on board! Heavy crew casualties!

00:19:20.493 --> 00:19:23.079
Seal all bulkheads and locate the intruders!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.206
Do not let them into the engine area!

00:19:25.457 --> 00:19:27.500
Sounds like poisonous snakes
have slithered aboard...

00:19:34.841 --> 00:19:37.427
<i>I will</i> protect Turan's territory!

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:40.305
Fine, just sit tight and behave!

00:19:40.555 --> 00:19:42.682
I won't let anyone pass!

00:19:42.932 --> 00:19:45.894
No response from #3 and #4 Turrets!

00:19:46.144 --> 00:19:47.479
BHdge!BHdge!

00:19:47.729 --> 00:19:50.523
Fam, Millia, and Giselle,
requesting permission to take off!

00:19:50.774 --> 00:19:51.900
Granted.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:55.612
The Silvius is currently
fending off an enemy intrusion.

00:19:55.862 --> 00:19:57.864
Take Princess Millia to a safe location.

00:19:58.114 --> 00:20:00.742
Don't worry. We <i>will</i> come to collect you later.

00:20:00.992 --> 00:20:03.411
--Roger!
--Don't get shot down now!

00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.955
--You guys stay safe too!
--Yeah!

00:20:06.206 --> 00:20:08.041
The captain said to take this!

00:20:09.751 --> 00:20:11.086
Fair winds to you!

00:20:11.336 --> 00:20:13.380
Good tailwinds!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.617
Enemy raid!

00:20:59.634 --> 00:21:02.554
They've taken over the engines.

00:21:02.804 --> 00:21:04.597
We're beaten...

00:21:17.235 --> 00:21:19.154
A scion of the White, huh?

00:21:19.404 --> 00:21:21.489
You seem to be from the Guild as well.

00:21:21.739 --> 00:21:26.286
I've heard of twin bodyguards
who serve a Maestro, but...

00:21:40.341 --> 00:21:41.342
What's going on?!

00:21:41.593 --> 00:21:43.595
Don't tell me the Silvius just...!

00:21:52.103 --> 00:21:53.855
Three ships off our port rear!

00:21:54.105 --> 00:21:55.690
I'm climbing!

00:22:03.865 --> 00:22:07.619
Vanships detected, heading north-northeast.

00:22:07.869 --> 00:22:12.457
ETA to restricted airspace, 30 minutes.

00:22:12.707 --> 00:22:14.417
What affiliation are they?

00:22:14.667 --> 00:22:19.923
Three Federation ships plus one
unknown they appear to be pursuing.

00:22:31.017 --> 00:22:36.606
<i>Sora wa dore hodo takai no darou</i>

00:22:36.856 --> 00:22:42.654
<i>Kaze wa dore hodo tsuyoi no darou</i>

00:22:42.904 --> 00:22:48.493
<i>Mizu wa dore hodo sunderu darou</i>

00:22:48.743 --> 00:22:55.792
<i>Kimi no mune no naka dewa</i>

00:22:57.001 --> 00:23:08.471
<i>Namida uketomeru
kimi no te no hira ni itsuka naritai</i>

00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:20.567
<i>Onaji kanashimi onaji kuuki wo wakeaitai</i>

00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:26.406
<i>lma hashiridasu fune no saki wo</i>

00:23:26.656 --> 00:23:35.206
<i>Tamerawazu kimi no muki e susumete</i>

00:23:35.456 --> 00:23:41.170
<i>Kaze no umi de hobashira wo tate</i>

00:23:41.421 --> 00:23:46.968
<i>Kumo no nami wo suberihajimeyou</i>

00:23:47.218 --> 00:23:52.724
<i>Tooi hoshi wo konpasu ni shite</i>

00:23:52.974 --> 00:24:00.648
<i>Kimi to mezasu kanata e</i>

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:05.111
<i>Millia.</i>

00:24:05.361 --> 00:24:09.115
<i>As ones bearing the future of Turan,
we'll have to work hard too, huh?</i>

00:24:09.365 --> 00:24:13.036
<i>Yeah! I'll study lots and lots
so I can help you, Sister!</i>

00:24:13.286 --> 00:24:15.455
<i>I fully appreciate your ambition.</i>

00:24:15.705 --> 00:24:17.332
<i>Good luck, Dad!</i>

00:24:17.582 --> 00:24:22.503
<i>Someday I wanna fly!
With everyone smiling like this!</i>

00:24:22.754 --> 00:24:25.006
<i>Look closely, Siri.</i>

00:24:25.256 --> 00:24:28.509
<i>This is the world you shall protect.</i>
